{{wikipedia|lang=ru}}

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|ru|фоксал}}, {{l|ru|воксал}}, {{l|ru|воксгал}} {{qualifier|obsolete}}

===Etymology===
{{bor|ru|en|Vauxhall}} (site of a pleasure garden and major railway station). The ending was influenced by {{m|ru|зал||hall}}. The spelling {{m|ru|фоксал}} attested in 1777 is from {{cog|fr|facs-hall}}, from the same English source.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|вокза́л}}
* {{audio|Ru-вокзал.ogg|audio|lang=ru}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|вокза́л}}

# {{lb|ru|obsolete}} [[park]], [[pleasure garden]]
#* '''1813''', Aleksandr Pushkin, ‘To Natalie’
#*: ''На гуляньях иль в '''воксалах''' / Легким зефиром летал.'' At fetes and in parks, I've been flitting like a gentle zephyr.
# [[train station]], [[railroad station]], [[railway station]], [[depot]]

